  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Australian Conservatorium of Music graduate and former jazz musician Timmy Trumpet has very much turned his formal schooling on its head over the last decade. He is now more associated with explosive dance sounds and colourful Las Vegas residencies than sit down performances. 2026 has been another big year of touring, but another big moment was the unveiling of his new album ‘Revelations’, a 15-track suite packed with vocals and an emotional arc that maps heartbreak moments of renewal. It’s a more song-driven approach in place of the festival-sized anthems he has served up in the past, and features guests like John Martin, Moa Lisa and Martin Jasper.",
